  --approval-sha256 "$APPROVAL_SHA256" \
  --patch-sha256 "$PATCH_SHA256" \
  --action commit \
  --head-branch "uca/$TASK_ID"
```

Use `--action commit` to create only the verified local feature ref, `--action push` to also perform
the lease-guarded feature-branch publication, or `--action draft_pr` when the trusted adapter exposes
a Draft-PR creator. The feature branch must differ from the base branch. A push names only that
feature ref and either creates it from an absent state under an exact zero-object lease or recognizes
the exact approved commit as an idempotent replay. An exact completed replay returns the immutable
